                  "oneOfCase": "RRT_V2_BLOCK_ELEMENTS_JSON",
                  "rrtV2BlockElementsJson": "{\"children\":[[\"paragraph\",{\"numbering\":\"#none\",\"indent-level\":0,\"children\":[[\"text\",{\"value\":\"A: So with your new car, you would like the seat covers and the window care kit. That’s great. Could I also interest you in our car alarm package?\\nB: No, thank you. Is it okay to pay using a check? My credit card expired last week.\\nA: Certainly, madam. We just need to complete the registration paperwork before you pay. Could I see your driver’s license, please? I need to make a copy of it for our records.\"}]]}]]}"
                }
